   "value": "ClearAll[ReplaceDummyIndices];\nReplaceDummyIndices[expr_]:=Module[{dummies,replacements},(*Find all dummy index symbols like \\[Mu]$1234*)dummies=DeleteDuplicates@Cases[expr,s_Symbol/;StringMatchQ[SymbolName[s],___~~\"$\"~~NumberString],{0,Infinity}];\n(*Replace each dummy with base name plus running number:\\[Mu]$1234->\\[Mu]1*)replacements=Thread[dummies->MapIndexed[With[{base=StringReplace[SymbolName[#1],\"$\"~~__->\"\"]},ToExpression[base<>ToString[#2[[1]]]]]&,dummies]];\nexpr/. replacements];",
